<title>CHINA: Safety Godown year net up 57 pct.</title>
<headline>Safety Godown year net up 57 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   69    vs 44</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    23    vs 25</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  62.22 vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    93.65 vs 59.63</p>
<p>    Turnover		     99.61 vs 137.10</p>
<p>    Company name		 Safety Godown Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 22-29</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Safety Godown is involved in warehousing, property development  and share investment. Exceptional gain representS profit from sale  of godown premises.</p>
<p>Total dividend for the year is 43 cents (including interim dividend  of 20 cents) vs 43 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
